## Project Structure

```text
noa_root/
├── sys/          # Core runtime (Rust)
├── p2p/          # P2P services (Go)
├── ai/           # AI providers, models, prompts
├── config/       # Configuration files
├── bin/          # Executables
├── opt/          # Optional packages (llama.cpp, etc.)
└── scripts/      # Setup and utility scripts
```

## Commands

```bash
# Bootstrap
./scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap.ps1   # Windows
./scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh    # Unix

# Validation
noa validate                        # Check environment
./init/check-prereqs.sh             # Check prerequisites
```

## Code Style

- **Rust**: Use rustfmt, clippy
- **Go**: Use golangci-lint
- **TypeScript**: Use eslint
- **Python**: Use ruff

